/*  CONSTANT NAME:      _dirOrthog
    DESCRIPTION:*//**The 4 scalar position-deltas for the orthogonal (cardinal) directions, as a vertical array in canonical clockwise order from north (up, right, down, left) matching _arrowsOrthog. Each is a single integer to add to a TOPOS position (derived from _mult, so it follows the one multiplier).*/
/*  REVISIONS:          Date        Developer   Description
                        2026-06-19  Claude      Initial version
                        2026-08-20  Claude      Canonical order is now clockwise from north (= SORT order of _arrowsAll)
                        2026-11-06  Claude      Derived from _mult instead of a literal 100000 (#380)
*/
_dirOrthog = _mult * {-1;0;1;0} + {0;1;0;-1};
